Example: WhatsApp

1. When I search for something in WhatsApp, my phone sends the search request through Wi-Fi or mobile data.

2. The request travels through the internet and reaches the WhatsApp server.

3. The server processes the search request and finds the required data.

4. The result is sent back from the WhatsApp server through the internet to my phone.

5. WhatsApp displays the search results on my screen.
